"use strict";(Array.isArray(self.webpackChunkwoocommerce_multivendor_marketplace_docs)?self.webpackChunkwoocommerce_multivendor_marketplace_docs:self.webpackChunkwoocommerce_multivendor_marketplace_docs=[]).push([[6705],{84575(e,t,o){e.exports=o.p+"assets/img/customer-pdp-report-product-modal.b2751b27.webp"},86822(e,t,o){e.exports=o.p+"assets/img/customer-pdp-reviews-section.73151606.webp"},72182(e,t,o){o.r(t),o.d(t,{comp:()=>u,data:()=>h});var r=o(20641);const s=o.p+"assets/img/customer-flag-report-overview.c362ff76.webp",i=o.p+"assets/img/customer-vendor-profile-report-button.f6fa6a6c.webp",a=o.p+"assets/img/customer-vendor-flag-modal.6c521089.webp",n=o.p+"assets/img/customer-vendor-flag-custom-reason.79ed460e.webp",l=o.p+"assets/img/customer-pdp-report-product-button.3cbea8e8.webp";var p=o(84575);const d=o.p+"assets/img/customer-pdp-report-product-custom-reason.8b4848e2.webp";var c=o(86822);const g={},u=(0,o(66262).A)(g,[["render",function(e,t){return(0,r.uX)(),(0,r.CE)("div",null,t[0]||(t[0]=[(0,r.Fv)('<h1 id="report-flag-a-vendor" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#report-flag-a-vendor"><span>Report / Flag a Vendor</span></a></h1><p>In an open multi-vendor marketplace, shoppers buy goods directly from independent merchants. To guarantee a trustworthy, safe, and transparent shopping environment, the <strong>WooCommerce Multi-Vendor Marketplace</strong> provides a built-in <strong>Customer Flag &amp; Report</strong> system.</p><p>As a customer or guest visitor, you can report suspicious stores or problematic product listings with a few clicks. Your reports go directly to marketplace administrators, helping maintain top-tier catalog standards, protect buyers against counterfeit goods, and hold sellers accountable to marketplace policies.</p><p><a class="doc-image-link" href="./assets/customer-flag-report-overview.webp"><img src="'+s+'" alt="WooCommerce Multi-Vendor Marketplace Customer Flag and Report Overview"></a></p><hr><h2 id="why-report-a-vendor-or-product-listing" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#why-report-a-vendor-or-product-listing"><span>Why Report a Vendor or Product Listing?</span></a></h2><p>Marketplace reporting helps keep the shopping ecosystem clean and reliable. You should consider submitting a report when you encounter:</p><ul><li><strong>Misleading or Inaccurate Information</strong>: Specifications, product descriptions, or photos that do not match the actual item.</li><li><strong>Counterfeit or Resold Goods</strong>: Products suspected of being unauthorized replicas, counterfeit items, or infringing upon copyright/trademarks.</li><li><strong>Unresponsive or Poor Communication</strong>: Sellers who fail to answer order inquiries, messages, or refund requests.</li><li><strong>Repeated Late Dispatch or Cancellations</strong>: Merchants who frequently delay order fulfillment or cancel orders without valid reason.</li><li><strong>Prohibited or Unsafe Items</strong>: Listings that violate marketplace terms, safety guidelines, or local consumer regulations.</li><li><strong>Pricing Discrepancies</strong>: Hidden charges, sudden price inflations, or deceptive promotional pricing.</li></ul><div class="hint-container tip"><p class="hint-container-title">Safe and Confidential Reporting</p><p>When you report a store or product listing, your report is sent directly to the marketplace moderation team. Your personal contact information is kept private and is never shared directly with the reported seller.</p></div><hr><h2 id="customer-flagging-touchpoints" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#customer-flagging-touchpoints"><span>Customer Flagging Touchpoints</span></a></h2><p>Customers can submit flag reports from two primary storefront touchpoints, depending on whether the issue involves overall store operations or an individual catalog listing:</p><div class="modes-showcase"><div class="modes-grid"><div class="mode-card"><div class="mode-card__badge-wrap"><span class="mode-card__badge mode-card__badge--secondary">Store-Level Dispute</span><span class="mode-card__endpoint">/vendor/[store-name]/</span></div><div class="mode-card__header"><div class="mode-card__icon"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 9l9-7 9 7v11a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"></path><polyline points="9 22 9 12 15 12 15 22"></polyline></svg></div><div class="mode-card__titles"><div class="mode-card__title">Vendor Store Profile Flag</div><p>Report merchant conduct, communication &amp; fulfillment</p></div></div><ul class="mode-card__features"><li><strong>Trigger Location:</strong> <em>About this Vendor</em> card on the seller&#39;s storefront</li><li><strong>Target Scope:</strong> The entire merchant account &amp; seller standing</li><li><strong>Common Concerns:</strong> Unanswered messages, dispatch delays, order cancellations</li><li><strong>Resolution:</strong> Logged on seller profile; impacts marketplace account health</li></ul><div class="mode-card__footer"><span class="mode-card__footer-label">Action:</span><code>Report Vendor</code></div></div><div class="mode-card"><div class="mode-card__badge-wrap"><span class="mode-card__badge mode-card__badge--primary">Listing-Level Dispute</span><span class="mode-card__endpoint">/product/[item-slug]/</span></div><div class="mode-card__header"><div class="mode-card__icon"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="9" cy="21" r="1"></circle><circle cx="20" cy="21" r="1"></circle><path d="M1 1h4l2.68 13.39a2 2 0 0 0 2 1.61h9.72a2 2 0 0 0 2-1.61L23 6H6"></path></svg></div><div class="mode-card__titles"><div class="mode-card__title">Product Listing Flag</div><p>Report single item listings, catalog inaccuracies &amp; safety</p></div></div><ul class="mode-card__features"><li><strong>Trigger Location:</strong> Product summary section next to purchasing buttons</li><li><strong>Target Scope:</strong> An individual catalog item and specific listing SKU</li><li><strong>Common Concerns:</strong> Misleading photos, wrong pricing, copyright theft, prohibited items</li><li><strong>Resolution:</strong> Logged on catalog SKU; triggers admin listing investigation</li></ul><div class="mode-card__footer"><span class="mode-card__footer-label">Action:</span><code>Report Product</code></div></div></div></div><hr><h2 id="customer-flagging-workflow" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#customer-flagging-workflow"><span>Customer Flagging Workflow</span></a></h2><p>Follow this 5-step journey to submit an issue report from any storefront touchpoint:</p><div class="wkmp-workflow-pipeline"><div class="wkmp-workflow-step"><div><div class="wkmp-workflow-step__top"><span class="wkmp-workflow-step__number">STEP 01</span><span class="wkmp-workflow-step__icon">🔎</span></div><div class="wkmp-workflow-step__title">Locate Report Button</div><p class="wkmp-workflow-step__desc">Find the <strong>Report Vendor</strong> button on the store profile or <strong>Report Product</strong> on the item page.</p></div><div class="wkmp-workflow-step__loc">📍 Store Profile or PDP</div></div><div class="wkmp-workflow-step"><div><div class="wkmp-workflow-step__top"><span class="wkmp-workflow-step__number">STEP 02</span><span class="wkmp-workflow-step__icon">📝</span></div><div class="wkmp-workflow-step__title">Provide Contact Details</div><p class="wkmp-workflow-step__desc">Enter your name and email if visiting as a guest. Logged-in accounts are linked automatically.</p></div><div class="wkmp-workflow-step__loc">📍 Report Modal Header</div></div><div class="wkmp-workflow-step"><div><div class="wkmp-workflow-step__top"><span class="wkmp-workflow-step__number">STEP 03</span><span class="wkmp-workflow-step__icon">🔘</span></div><div class="wkmp-workflow-step__title">Select Flag Reason</div><p class="wkmp-workflow-step__desc">Choose an appropriate reason from the predefined list matching the exact problem you experienced.</p></div><div class="wkmp-workflow-step__loc">📍 Predefined Reason List</div></div><div class="wkmp-workflow-step"><div><div class="wkmp-workflow-step__top"><span class="wkmp-workflow-step__number">STEP 04</span><span class="wkmp-workflow-step__icon">💬</span></div><div class="wkmp-workflow-step__title">Add Custom Description</div><p class="wkmp-workflow-step__desc">Select <strong>Other</strong> to reveal a description box where you can supply specific evidence or notes.</p></div><div class="wkmp-workflow-step__loc">📍 Optional Description Box</div></div><div class="wkmp-workflow-step"><div><div class="wkmp-workflow-step__top"><span class="wkmp-workflow-step__number">STEP 05</span><span class="wkmp-workflow-step__icon">🚀</span></div><div class="wkmp-workflow-step__title">Submit &amp; Verify</div><p class="wkmp-workflow-step__desc">Click <strong>Report</strong>. An instant confirmation appears and your grievance is logged for admin review.</p></div><div class="wkmp-workflow-step__loc">📍 Modal Footer Action</div></div></div><hr><h2 id="how-to-report-a-vendor-store-profile" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#how-to-report-a-vendor-store-profile"><span>How to Report a Vendor (Store Profile)</span></a></h2><p>When you experience problems with a seller&#39;s overall conduct, store information, or customer service, you can flag their store directly from their public vendor page.</p><h3 id="_1-locate-the-report-vendor-link" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-locate-the-report-vendor-link"><span>1. Locate the &quot;Report Vendor&quot; Link</span></a></h3><p>Visit the vendor&#39;s storefront (e.g., <code>/vendor/aurora-athletics/</code>). In the <strong>About this Vendor</strong> card on the right-hand side, look for the <strong>Report Vendor</strong> link marked with a flag icon (<span class="dashicons dashicons-flag"></span>).</p><p><a class="doc-image-link" href="./assets/customer-vendor-profile-report-button.webp"><img src="'+i+'" alt="Report Vendor Button on Vendor Store Profile"></a></p><h3 id="_2-open-the-report-modal" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_2-open-the-report-modal"><span>2. Open the Report Modal</span></a></h3><p>Clicking <strong>Report Vendor</strong> opens an interactive modal centered on your screen.</p><p><a class="doc-image-link" href="./assets/customer-vendor-flag-modal.webp"><img src="'+a+'" alt="Vendor Flag Reporting Modal Form"></a></p><h3 id="_3-enter-your-details-guest-shoppers" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_3-enter-your-details-guest-shoppers"><span>3. Enter Your Details (Guest Shoppers)</span></a></h3><ul><li><strong>Logged-in Customers</strong>: Your user account is recognized automatically. The modal skips name and email fields and links your registered profile to the report.</li><li><strong>Guest Shoppers</strong>: Enter your full name in the <strong>Your Name</strong> input and your contact email in the <strong>Your Email</strong> input.</li></ul><h3 id="_4-choose-an-appropriate-vendor-reason" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_4-choose-an-appropriate-vendor-reason"><span>4. Choose an Appropriate Vendor Reason</span></a></h3><p>Select the radio button that best describes your grievance:</p><ul><li><strong>Poor communication or unanswered messages</strong>: The seller ignores messages or inquiries.</li><li><strong>Repeated late dispatch</strong>: Orders take an unusually long time to ship without explanation.</li><li><strong>Item not as described</strong>: Goods received from this seller differ significantly from store descriptions.</li><li><strong>Unclear return or refund policy</strong>: The seller refuses to honor stated refund guidelines or terms.</li><li><strong>Repeated order cancellations</strong>: Orders are abruptly cancelled after payment confirmation.</li><li><strong>Suspected counterfeit or resold goods</strong>: The seller appears to offer unauthorized replicas.</li><li><strong>Misleading store or shipping information</strong>: Inaccurate store location, processing times, or carrier information.</li><li><strong>Unresponsive to customer messages</strong>: Inquiries regarding active purchases receive no response.</li><li><strong>Suspected counterfeit products</strong>: Products listed across the store are suspected fakes.</li><li><strong>Other</strong>: Use this option when your concern does not fit any of the predefined categories.</li></ul><h3 id="_5-writing-a-custom-reason" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_5-writing-a-custom-reason"><span>5. Writing a Custom Reason</span></a></h3><p>When you select the <strong>Other</strong> option, the modal automatically displays a text area with the placeholder: <em>Write a reason to report this seller.</em> Enter a brief explanation of the issue so marketplace managers can investigate effectively.</p><p><a class="doc-image-link" href="./assets/customer-vendor-flag-custom-reason.webp"><img src="'+n+'" alt="Submitting Custom Reason in Vendor Flag Modal"></a></p><h3 id="_6-submit-your-report" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_6-submit-your-report"><span>6. Submit Your Report</span></a></h3><p>Click the primary <strong>Report</strong> button.</p><ul><li>The system validates your submission (verifying that required fields are filled and a valid reason is picked).</li><li>A notification toast confirms that your report was submitted successfully.</li><li>The modal closes automatically, and the report button is hidden for that session to prevent duplicate submissions.</li></ul><hr><h2 id="how-to-report-a-product-listing-product-detail-page" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#how-to-report-a-product-listing-product-detail-page"><span>How to Report a Product Listing (Product Detail Page)</span></a></h2><p>If you find an issue with a single item—such as misleading photographs, incorrect pricing, or restricted products—report the listing directly from the Product Detail Page (PDP).</p><h3 id="_1-locate-the-report-product-button" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-locate-the-report-product-button"><span>1. Locate the &quot;Report Product&quot; Button</span></a></h3><p>Open any vendor product page (e.g., <code>/product/aurora-pace-fitness-watch/</code>). The <strong>Report Product</strong> button appears directly within the main product summary area next to the purchase options.</p><p><a class="doc-image-link" href="./assets/customer-pdp-report-product-button.webp"><img src="'+l+'" alt="Report Product Button on Product Detail Page"></a></p><h3 id="_2-open-the-product-flag-form" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_2-open-the-product-flag-form"><span>2. Open the Product Flag Form</span></a></h3><p>Click <strong>Report Product</strong> to open the reporting popup modal.</p><p><a class="doc-image-link" href="./assets/customer-pdp-report-product-modal.webp"><img src="'+p+'" alt="Product Flag Modal Overview on PDP"></a></p><h3 id="_3-complete-reporter-information" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_3-complete-reporter-information"><span>3. Complete Reporter Information</span></a></h3><ul><li>For guest buyers, fill in <strong>Your Name*</strong> and <strong>Your Email*</strong>.</li><li>For signed-in users, your customer ID and username are attached in the background.</li></ul><h3 id="_4-select-a-product-flag-reason" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_4-select-a-product-flag-reason"><span>4. Select a Product Flag Reason</span></a></h3><p>Select the radio option that best reflects the issue with the listing:</p><ul><li><strong>Misleading product photographs</strong>: Images do not show the real item, or represent features not included in the purchase.</li><li><strong>Incorrect pricing or hidden charges</strong>: The price shown does not reflect reality or conceals unlisted mandatory fees.</li><li><strong>Prohibited or unsafe item</strong>: The item violates product safety regulations or marketplace catalog policies.</li><li><strong>Copied listing or stolen imagery</strong>: The seller has plagiarized another merchant&#39;s text or photos.</li><li><strong>Inaccurate product description</strong>: Key specifications (size, material, compatibility) are wrong.</li><li><strong>Prohibited or restricted item</strong>: Products that require permits or are banned from sale.</li><li><strong>Copyright or trademark violation</strong>: Counterfeit brand goods or unauthorized brand logo usage.</li><li><strong>Other / Briefly describe the issue</strong>: Any other product-related dispute.</li></ul><h3 id="_5-add-custom-product-notes" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_5-add-custom-product-notes"><span>5. Add Custom Product Notes</span></a></h3><p>If you choose <strong>Other</strong> (or want to specify additional details), write a brief note in the text box explaining why the product listing should be investigated.</p><p><a class="doc-image-link" href="./assets/customer-pdp-report-product-custom-reason.webp"><img src="'+d+'" alt="Product Report Modal with Custom Description Filled"></a></p><h3 id="_6-submit-the-product-report" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_6-submit-the-product-report"><span>6. Submit the Product Report</span></a></h3><p>Click <strong>Report</strong>. An inline confirmation message verifies that your submission was received, and the window closes automatically after a few seconds.</p><hr><h2 id="product-reviews-vs-flagging-a-listing" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#product-reviews-vs-flagging-a-listing"><span>Product Reviews vs. Flagging a Listing</span></a></h2><p>It is important to understand when to write a <strong>Product Review</strong> and when to <strong>Report / Flag</strong> an item. Both features serve distinct roles in keeping the marketplace transparent:</p><p><a class="doc-image-link" href="./assets/customer-pdp-reviews-section.webp"><img src="'+c+'" alt="Product Reviews and Ratings Section on PDP"></a></p><table><thead><tr><th style="text-align:left;">Consideration</th><th style="text-align:left;">Product Review &amp; Rating</th><th style="text-align:left;">Flag &amp; Report Submission</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>Primary Goal</strong></td><td style="text-align:left;">Share personal consumer experience, opinions, and product feedback.</td><td style="text-align:left;">Report policy violations, illegal goods, fraudulent listings, or unsafe items.</td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>Visibility</strong></td><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>Public</strong>: Displayed publicly under the <em>Reviews</em> tab on the product page.</td><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>Private</strong>: Sent strictly to marketplace administrators for moderation.</td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>Typical Scenarios</strong></td><td style="text-align:left;">Product quality, comfort, fit, battery life, usability, and design.</td><td style="text-align:left;">Counterfeit brand items, stolen images, abusive behavior, and non-delivery scams.</td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>Who Evaluates It?</strong></td><td style="text-align:left;">Other shoppers reading reviews before making purchasing decisions.</td><td style="text-align:left;">Marketplace administrators and compliance officers conducting investigations.</td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>Customer Action</strong></td><td style="text-align:left;">Click <strong>Write a Review</strong> under the Reviews section.</td><td style="text-align:left;">Click <strong>Report Product</strong> or <strong>Report Vendor</strong> with the flag icon.</td></tr></tbody></table><div class="hint-container tip"><p class="hint-container-title">Where to Share Honest Feedback</p><p>If a product arrived in working condition but did not meet your personal expectations (such as color tone or fit), use the <strong>Write a Review</strong> feature on the product page. Reserve the <strong>Report Product</strong> button for deceptive listings, policy infractions, or counterfeit merchandise.</p></div>',62)]))}]]),h=JSON.parse('{"path":"/documentation/customer-flag-report.html","title":"Report / Flag a Vendor – Customer Guide | WooCommerce Multi-Vendor Marketplace","lang":"en-US","frontmatter":{"title":"Report / Flag a Vendor – Customer Guide | WooCommerce Multi-Vendor Marketplace","description":"Complete customer guide on how to report a vendor or flag a product listing in WooCommerce Multi-Vendor Marketplace. Learn how to report suspicious sellers, submit flag reasons, and protect your shopping experience.","head":[["meta",{"name":"keywords","content":"woocommerce report vendor, flag seller woocommerce, report marketplace product, customer report store, flag vendor profile, report fake product woocommerce, marketplace buyer protection, report inaccurate listing"}],["meta",{"property":"og:title","content":"Report / Flag a Vendor – Customer Guide | WooCommerce Multi-Vendor Marketplace"}],["meta",{"property":"og:description","content":"Step-by-step buyer guide on how to report a vendor or flag a product in WooCommerce Multi-Vendor Marketplace. Discover reporting options, reason selection, and admin dispute reviews."}],["meta",{"property":"og:type","content":"article"}]]},"headers":[{"level":2,"title":"Why Report a Vendor or Product Listing?","slug":"why-report-a-vendor-or-product-listing","link":"#why-report-a-vendor-or-product-listing","children":[]},{"level":2,"title":"Customer Flagging Touchpoints","slug":"customer-flagging-touchpoints","link":"#customer-flagging-touchpoints","children":[]},{"level":2,"title":"Customer Flagging Workflow","slug":"customer-flagging-workflow","link":"#customer-flagging-workflow","children":[]},{"level":2,"title":"How to Report a Vendor (Store Profile)","slug":"how-to-report-a-vendor-store-profile","link":"#how-to-report-a-vendor-store-profile","children":[{"level":3,"title":"1. Locate the \\"Report Vendor\\" Link","slug":"_1-locate-the-report-vendor-link","link":"#_1-locate-the-report-vendor-link","children":[]},{"level":3,"title":"2. Open the Report Modal","slug":"_2-open-the-report-modal","link":"#_2-open-the-report-modal","children":[]},{"level":3,"title":"3. Enter Your Details (Guest Shoppers)","slug":"_3-enter-your-details-guest-shoppers","link":"#_3-enter-your-details-guest-shoppers","children":[]},{"level":3,"title":"4. Choose an Appropriate Vendor Reason","slug":"_4-choose-an-appropriate-vendor-reason","link":"#_4-choose-an-appropriate-vendor-reason","children":[]},{"level":3,"title":"5. Writing a Custom Reason","slug":"_5-writing-a-custom-reason","link":"#_5-writing-a-custom-reason","children":[]},{"level":3,"title":"6. Submit Your Report","slug":"_6-submit-your-report","link":"#_6-submit-your-report","children":[]}]},{"level":2,"title":"How to Report a Product Listing (Product Detail Page)","slug":"how-to-report-a-product-listing-product-detail-page","link":"#how-to-report-a-product-listing-product-detail-page","children":[{"level":3,"title":"1. Locate the \\"Report Product\\" Button","slug":"_1-locate-the-report-product-button","link":"#_1-locate-the-report-product-button","children":[]},{"level":3,"title":"2. Open the Product Flag Form","slug":"_2-open-the-product-flag-form","link":"#_2-open-the-product-flag-form","children":[]},{"level":3,"title":"3. Complete Reporter Information","slug":"_3-complete-reporter-information","link":"#_3-complete-reporter-information","children":[]},{"level":3,"title":"4. Select a Product Flag Reason","slug":"_4-select-a-product-flag-reason","link":"#_4-select-a-product-flag-reason","children":[]},{"level":3,"title":"5. Add Custom Product Notes","slug":"_5-add-custom-product-notes","link":"#_5-add-custom-product-notes","children":[]},{"level":3,"title":"6. Submit the Product Report","slug":"_6-submit-the-product-report","link":"#_6-submit-the-product-report","children":[]}]},{"level":2,"title":"Product Reviews vs. Flagging a Listing","slug":"product-reviews-vs-flagging-a-listing","link":"#product-reviews-vs-flagging-a-listing","children":[]}],"git":{},"filePathRelative":"documentation/customer-flag-report.md"}')}}]);